    "description": "When an enemy or ally within 20 squares of you is reduced to 0 Hit Points, you gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> equal to 5 + one-half your Character Level. Damage is subtracted from <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> first, and any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> remaining at the end of the encounter go away. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> do not stack.",
